ommitment (Non-Repudiation):** No repudio"},"819":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas-157","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas#emisión-de-certificados","content":"**Key Encipherment:** Cifrado de claves"},"820":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas-158","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas#emisión-de-certificados","content":"**Data Encipherment:** Cifrado de datos"},"821":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas-159","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas#emisión-de-certificados","content":"**Key Agreement:** Acuerdo de claves"},"822":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas-160","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas#emisión-de-certificados","content":"**Certificate Signing:** Firma de certificados"},"823":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas-161","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas#emisión-de-certificados","content":"**CRL Signing:** Firma de listas de revocación"},"824":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas-162","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas#emisión-de-certificados","content":"**Encipher Only:** Solo cifrado"},"825":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas-163","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-25/manual/servicios-core/cas#emisión-de-certificados","con